# The MetaX build installs the plugin as an editable checkout and keeps the
# examples/tests for reproduction. Exclude repository history, local models,
# credentials, caches, and unrelated files.
**
!pyproject.toml
!LICENSE
!README.md
!README_zh.md
!sglang_fl/
!sglang_fl/**
!examples/
!examples/**
!tests/
!tests/**
!.github/
!.github/scripts/
!.github/scripts/metax/
!.github/scripts/metax/**
!docker/
!docker/metax/
!docker/metax/**
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.egg-info/
